[00:03.66] He couldn't pay the bills so he moved his family
[00:05.51] In a cheap apartment near a wast refinery
[00:07.84] They didn't know their water was infected with the slime
[00:10.02] That they dump into the water barrels at a time
[00:12.47] A deadly reaction sets forth
[00:14.11] A hazardous mutation to end all creation is born
[00:20.45] Pitiless fluid corroding like acid
[00:22.58] Flesh torn!
[00:24.93] Whose skins unprotected will soon be infected
[00:26.99] Be warned
[00:41.15] Radiation is spreading
[00:42.26] Human lives are ending
[00:43.41] No one can stop this
[00:44.68] Mutated race of the damned
[00:46.97] Across infected lands
[00:50.29] In a panic he ran screaming
[00:51.41] From his wife and kids
[00:52.60] The image burned into his mind
[00:53.62] Of their corroded limbs
[00:54.79] As the smell of rotting flesh
[00:55.96] Begins to attract flies
[00:56.92] They knew that they could never
[00:57.93] Return to their normal lives
[01:18.95] 